From edb02cb1e2bde6465e9b4ceb7ea1c15b7b0c2149 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammed <91819504+mohammed7s@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:09:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] cp2a: enable Computer Control and its per-app consent

Turn on android.companion.virtualdevice.flags.computer_control_access and
computer_control_per_app_consent, READ_ONLY like the other Computer Control
flags in this release config.

Without computer_control_access the ACCESS_COMPUTER_CONTROL permission is
not defined and VirtualDeviceManagerService refuses every session request.
Without computer_control_per_app_consent the user cannot approve or revoke
an agent per target app, and the Settings pages that manage this are
hidden.

This only makes the feature reachable. No app can use it until the user
approves an agent and its target apps in Settings, and the agent must
also hold the assistant role (computer_control_role_assistant_requirement
is already enabled here).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../computer_control_access_flag_values.textproto           | 6 ++++++
 .../computer_control_per_app_consent_flag_values.textproto  | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_access_flag_values.textproto
 create mode 100644 aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_per_app_consent_flag_values.textproto

diff --git a/aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_access_flag_values.textproto b/aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_access_flag_values.textproto
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ae9570a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_access_flag_values.textproto
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+flag_value {
+  package: "android.companion.virtualdevice.flags"
+  name: "computer_control_access"
+  state: ENABLED
+  permission: READ_ONLY
+}
diff --git a/aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_per_app_consent_flag_values.textproto b/aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_per_app_consent_flag_values.textproto
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2245fc0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/aconfig/cp2a/android.companion.virtualdevice.flags/computer_control_per_app_consent_flag_values.textproto
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+flag_value {
+  package: "android.companion.virtualdevice.flags"
+  name: "computer_control_per_app_consent"
+  state: ENABLED
+  permission: READ_ONLY
+}
